stateDiagram-v2
    %% no single initial state: this conveyor's real trigger fires identically from most of its own states once its guard holds
    state none
    state implement
    state fix
    state merge
    state archive
    state stalled
    archive --> archive : fire.archive [g1]
    fix --> archive : fire.archive [g1]
    implement --> archive : fire.archive [g1]
    merge --> archive : fire.archive [g1]
    none --> archive : fire.archive [g1]
    stalled --> archive : fire.archive [g1]
    note right of stalled
        g1: (IF placer.bot THEN conveyor.run stands AND grant_placer.may_push ELSE placer.may_push) AND line.lane == opsx AND line.change_finished AND NOT ('archive' in line.fired AND line.open_pr_from_change)
    end note
